# The analyzer that answers a missing PushSender in a context where this starter's own startup
# refusal never ran. Its precedence over Spring Boot's own missing-bean analyzer is declared on the
# class with @Order, not taken from this file's position on the classpath.
org.springframework.boot.diagnostics.FailureAnalyzer=\
com.the13haven.push2u.spring.MissingPushSenderFailureAnalyzer
